  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "１０００まいの　コインで　からだができているらしい。　ひとなつこくだれとでも　すぐに　なかよくなれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸은 1000개의 코인으로 이뤄져 있다고 한다. 붙임성이 좋아서 누구와도 금방 친해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "據說身體是由１０００枚硬幣所組成的。喜歡與人親近，不管與誰都能馬上變得融洽。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son corps serait composé de 1 000 pièces. Sociable, il peut se lier d’amitié très rapidement avec n’importe qui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Körper soll aus 1000 Münzen bestehen. Es ist sehr umgänglich und schließt mit jedem rasch Freundschaft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que su cuerpo está formado por 1000 monedas. Es capaz de hacer buenas migas con cualquiera rápidamente por su sociabilidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pare che il suo corpo sia formato da 1.000 monete. È molto socievole e fa subito amicizia con chiunque.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its body seems to be made up of 1,000 coins. This Pokémon gets along well with others and is quick to make friends with anybody.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "１０００枚の　コインで　体ができているらしい。　人懐こくだれとでも　すぐに　仲良くなれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "据说它的身体是由１０００枚硬币组成的。喜欢与人亲近，不管与谁都能立刻处好关系。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que su cuerpo está formado por 1000 monedas. Es capaz de hacer buenas migas con cualquiera rápidamente por su sociabilidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "コインが　つみあがって　つくられたからだは　がんじょう。　コインを　れんしゃしててきを　あっとうする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "코인이 쌓여서 만들어진 몸은 상당히 튼튼하다. 코인을 연속으로 발사해서 상대를 압도한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "堆疊硬幣而形成的身體結實堅固。會連續發射硬幣來壓制敵人。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son corps robuste est composé de pièces empilées. Il accable ses adversaires en leur lançant des rafales de pièces.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein robuster Körper besteht aus gestapelten Münzen, die es in rascher Folge auf Feinde schießt, um sie zu überwältigen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su cuerpo está compuesto de monedas unidas entre sí, por lo que es muy resistente. Abruma a sus enemigos disparándolas en ráfagas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo corpo, formato da pile di monete, è molto robusto. Annienta i nemici lanciando raffiche di monete.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has a sturdy body made up of stacked coins. Gholdengo overwhelms its enemies by firing coin after coin at them in quick succession.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "コインが　積みあがって　作られた体は　頑丈。　コインを　連射して敵を　圧倒する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
